    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27071" root="طمح" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِمْحٌ</span></b> , or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِمَحٌ</span>, (accord. to different copies of
the K,) expl. by Ibn-'Abbád, (K, TA,) in the
Moheet, (TA,) as the name of <i>A species of tree,</i>
is a mistake, being correctly with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خ</span>; (K,
TA;) or it is also called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طمخ</span> as well <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظمخ</span>.
(TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظمخ</span>.)

